  "notes": "COMMON COLLOCATIONS:\n- ⟦{気温|きおん}→気温：00235_kion⟧⟦の→の：09472_no⟧{低下|ていか} (drop in temperature)\n- ⟦{品質|ひんしつ}→品質：09507_hinshitsu⟧⟦の→の：09472_no⟧{低下|ていか} (decline in quality)\n- ⟦{体力|たいりょく}→体力：05318_tairyoku⟧⟦の→の：09472_no⟧{低下|ていか} (decrease in physical strength)\n- ⟦{学力|がくりょく}→学力：08551_gakuryoku⟧⟦の→の：09472_no⟧{低下|ていか} (decline in academic ability)\n- ⟦{出生率|しゅっせいりつ}→出生率：28416_shusseiritsu⟧⟦の→の：09472_no⟧{低下|ていか} (declining birth rate)\n- ⟦{士気|しき}→士気：19824_shiki⟧⟦の→の：09472_no⟧{低下|ていか} (drop in morale)\n\nHOMOPHONE: ⟦{定価|ていか}→定価：04066_teika⟧ (list price, regular price) - different kanji, different meaning.\n\nANTONYM: ⟦{向上|こうじょう}→向上：02731_koujou⟧ (improvement, advancement)",
